{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s","id":1373342,"title":"[Dark Eras fan] Satanic Panic of 80s-90s","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-07T01:41:25-08:00","id":1373342,"title":"[Dark Eras fan] Satanic Panic of 80s-90s","content":"Idea for <b>Dark Eras </b>setting of 1980s and 1990s in Western countries where there was satanistic panic, modern witch trials. Great time for <b>Hunter</b>, <b>Beast</b>, <b>Demon</b> - and maybe other stuff.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Darker Days Radio</i></a> made lately podcast about historical background of those times - <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/139-the-satanic-panic-a-secret-frequency/\" target=\"_blank\">http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/139...ret-frequency/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T00:20:05-08:00","id":1373493,"title":"","content":"That would be a great hunter/beast/demon thing, yeah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T04:41:06-07:00","id":1373528,"title":"","content":"I can see Beast and Hunter working, but why would Demon work with this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T04:55:12-07:00","id":1373530,"title":"","content":"I share Michael's doubts concerning Demons (either Unchained or Infernal). The lesson from the Satanic Panic was that people looked for villains where there were none, which made them overlook actual harm caused. It would be very tricky to introduce Demons without undermining that very point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T20:50:26-07:00","id":1373670,"title":"","content":"I think it would work for Demons only in a &quot;even a broken clock is right twice a day&quot; sense. Imagine your Cover degrading, not because the God-Machine or a rival cell is onto you, but because a bunch of self-righteous moral crusaders are trying to prove you worship their devil.<br /> <br /> Honestly, that's the main appeal of this Dark Era to me -- because in the World of Darkness, there really are cults and monsters in the shadows, it's just that this whole moral crusade that gripped the country <i>missed them entirely</i> while chasing a figment born of hysteria and dubious theraputic practices. Except for the moments when they don't, and a few people manage, almost in spite of themselves, to stumble into something real. How do different groups of Hunters cope with the surge of dilettantes and false leads? Were parts of the Long Night or the Malleus sucked into the hysteria, or were they the best-placed to intercede with fellow believers?<br /> <br /> Whereas on the monsters' end, on one hand, these crusaders are so far off target that they couldn't find the truth with both hands and a flashlight ... but on the other, that doesn't mean they're not a threat. And that's not counting the possibility of Heroes or other antagonist factions manipulating the hysteria to try to bait a monster out. But the knife cuts both ways -- Angels and their cultists would be in just as much danger of exposure as Demons, for instance, and both might have to work together to defuse an explosive situation. It plays with the idea that the Masquerade and its equivalents are necessary, because a large group of motivated mortals are in fact a potential threat, even to monsters.<br /> <br /> (Also, I might just be a sucker for the &quot;Even Evil Has Standards&quot; trope, but the idea of actual cults reacting to the ritual abuse narrative with disgust and offense amuses me greatly.)<br /> <br /> Anyway, I have two character concepts that would fit into this Dark Era:<ul><li>A psychotherapist who specializes in hypnotic regression to recover &quot;repressed&quot; memories. She's also a Hero, and under hypnosis her patients are able to recall the human face of the Horror that tormented their dreams. She doesn't yet know what to do with that information, though.</li> <li>An angel who's supposed to be running a false-flag operation. Rev. Jacob Corbett is one of the loudest voices in the media screeching about secret Satanic messages in your cornflakes, but his claims are so ridiculous and over-the-top that even the true believers find him hard to credit. That's by design, but the angel using him as Cover doesn't actually understand that, and thinks it's failing its mission ... which, ironically, is driving it to the brink of a Fall.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T21:01:53-07:00","id":1373673,"title":"","content":"<b>EDIT: Mad_Maudlin</b> putted it nicely when I was writing my post already. So use her explanation and my as supporting idea more. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s?p=1373528#post1373528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see Beast and Hunter working, but why would Demon work with this?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s?p=1373530#post1373530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I share Michael's doubts concerning Demons (either Unchained or Infernal). The lesson from the Satanic Panic was that people looked for villains where there were none, which made them overlook actual harm caused. It would be very tricky to introduce Demons without undermining that very point.</div> </div> </div> </div>As thinking more about the <i>Satanic Panic </i>as Dark Era, I watched one of inspiration for it in my head - <a href=\"https://x-files.fandom.com/wiki/Die_Hand_Die_Verletzt\" target=\"_blank\">X-Files episode <i>Die Hand Die Verletzt</i></a> - where after a teenager is ritualistically murdered in a small town, Mulder and Scully are caught up in a secret occult practice within the local PTA and a substitute teacher with odd powers.<br /> <br /> Spoilers! ( For series that have 25 years now... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) PTA is composed of <i>real </i>satanists that are throwing accusations of 'satanists conspiracy' all around to rise paranoia as passing as 'god fearing Christians'. Substitute teacher in episode is implied to be demon that come to town to 'give a lesson' to the satanists PTA so they would return to their faiths roots. Old time 'we test your faith by creating problem to you that you need to face'.<br /> <br /> For me, this is quintessential run of <b>Demon: the Desent</b> in <i>Satanic Panic</i> - you run occult spy ring in <b>DtD </b>to protect from God Machine. And then those conservatives are all calling 'satanists conspiracy' accusations, you have problems as you and your mates are natural scapegoats of that. <b>Inferno</b> demons are straight material here in the same vain, also.<br /> <br /> Also, this Era would look a lot like <b>Dark Eras 2</b> <i>Light of the Sun</i> in that matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-09-2020, 12:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T01:10:02-07:00","id":1373701,"title":"","content":"You two have convinced me it can be done <i>if</i> approached carefully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T03:10:36-07:00","id":1373719,"title":"","content":"The problem is that this isn't how the Satanic Panic worked. Most of it was just super vague conspiracy theory. Where it became serious was where actual children made accusations against specific people. That's only going to impact a very small number of Demons. Stay out of the day-care industry and you're fine.<br /> <br /> (Or in that one case in Britain, just don't run a quasi-satanic paedophile cult)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mad_Maudlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s?p=1373670#post1373670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but his claims are so ridiculous and over-the-top that even the true believers find him hard to credit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I seriously can't think of anything so silly that a Satanic Panic type wouldn't say it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T09:15:49-07:00","id":1373769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s?p=1373719#post1373719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that this isn't how the Satanic Panic worked. Most of it was just super vague conspiracy theory. Where it became serious was where actual children made accusations against specific people. That's only going to impact a very small number of Demons. Stay out of the day-care industry and you're fine.<br /> <br /> (Or in that one case in Britain, just don't run a quasi-satanic paedophile cult)<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>How broadly are we defining &quot;Satanic Panic&quot; here? The ritual child abuse allegations were obviously the most high-profile incidents, but they were part of a broader climate of paranoia that included claims like &quot;metal bands use backwards masking to brainwash kids&quot; and &quot;Dungeons and Dragons teaches real magic.&quot; The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Memphis_Three\" target=\"_blank\">West Memphis Three</a> were caught up in it, and my in-laws (who were Wiccans in Missouri) have stories about people being harassed, assaulted, losing jobs, etc. if they &quot;came out of the broom closet&quot; to the wrong person. That's still not a ton of people, sure, but it widens the net a little.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s#post1373342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Mad_Maudlin</b> putted it nicely when I was writing my post already. So use his explanation and my as supporting idea more.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, wyrd! Though my pronouns are she/her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T15:33:09-07:00","id":1373815,"title":"","content":"I mean I think if you more use that general fear and paranoia to cover that entire time period and not just the satanic panic it would work. Like someone said metal bands and people like Zappa and John Denver were caught up in it. and remember it wasn't just conservatives. There was this huge push for the government to &quot;Think of the children&quot; and it was really both sides that really played into to grab more power or to look more like they were helping the people. I mean you had such people like Tipper Gore(wife of Al Gore) and later in the 90s Hillary Clinton and Joe Liebermen going against the horror of video games like Night Trap and Mortal Kombat. So I think a good generalized setting explaining that it was a panic and not just a conservative/liberal conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-10T00:11:33-07:00","id":1373853,"title":"","content":"Don't Forget BADD and Patricia pulling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T00:47:45-07:00","id":1374518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1373342-dark-eras-fan-satanic-panic-of-80s-90s?p=1373528#post1373528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see Beast and Hunter working, but why would Demon work with this?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because they sort of are and sort of aren't the droids you're looking for, and mass hysteria and witch hunter/inquisitor stuff is used for a few settings in Dark Eras 2 involving demons. You could make the argument, to be sure, that having there be actual witches (and nearly any splat qualifies if you think about it) undermines the point in a witch hunting scenario, but there is sufficient precedent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T17:33:17-07:00","id":1374838,"title":"","content":"I was reminded of this thread when I read the tweet linked below. It's political AF, but it links Reagan Era religious politics with the modern day, and doesn't leave it at some monolithic &quot;Christianity,&quot; but points out Southern California New Age practices and prosperity gospel radically shifting the age.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/JYSexton/status/1238472745748398080?s=19\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1761813409832501248/KaNREMaX_400x400.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/JYSexton/status/1238472745748398080?s=19\" target=\"_blank\"> Jared Yates Sexton (@JYSexton) on X </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/JYSexton/status/1238472745748398080?s=19\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twitter.com/JYSexton/status/1238472745748398080?s=19 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> All right. We need to talk about a couple of vitally important things happening in the background that aren't quite in focus just yet but are going to define the coming days. White identity evangelicalism that holds Trump as a messiah and Trump's authoritarian nature. 1/ </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link"